<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="x-ua-compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>BDS Khang Ngo - Control Panel</title>
    <hta:application 
        id="oHTA"
        applicationname="BDSKhangNgoLauncher"
        border="thin"
        borderstyle="normal"
        caption="yes"
        icon=""
        maximizebutton="no"
        minimizebutton="yes"
        showintaskbar="yes"
        singleinstance="yes"
        sysmenu="yes"
        version="1.0"
        windowstate="normal"
        scroll="no"
    />
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-secondary: #1e293b;
            --accent-emerald: #10b981;
            --accent-amber: #f59e0b;
            --accent-indigo: #6366f1;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 25px;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #6366f1;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .group-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: left;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: white;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .btn-server-prd {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
        }
        .btn-server-stg {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
        }
        .btn-db-prd {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            color: #10b981;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-db-stg {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            color: #f59e0b;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-folder {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
    <script>
        // Resize window to control panel size on startup
        window.resizeTo(480, 680);

        function runScript(filename) {
            try {
                var shell = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
                // %~dp0 equivalents are handled by running directly
                shell.Run("cmd.exe /c " + filename, 1, false);
            } catch(e) {
                alert("Lỗi khởi chạy script: " + e.message);
            }
        }

        function openFolder(path) {
            try {
                var shell = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
                shell.Run("explorer.exe \"" + path + "\"", 1, false);
            } catch(e) {
                alert("Lỗi mở thư mục: " + e.message);
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>🛡️ BDS Khang Ngô - Control Panel</h1>
        <p>Bảng điều phối khởi động dịch vụ & cơ sở dữ liệu</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
        <div class="group-title">1. Khởi động Web Server (Có tự động mở Web)</div>
        <button class="btn btn-server-prd" onclick="runScript('CHAY_APP.bat')">
            🚀 Khởi chạy Server PRODUCTION
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-server-stg" onclick="runScript('CHAY_STAGING.bat')">
            🧪 Khởi chạy Server STAGING
        </button>

        <div class="group-title">2. Đồng bộ & Khôi phục CSDL từ Google Sheets</div>
        <button class="btn btn-db-prd" onclick="runScript('KHOI_PHUC_DB_PRD.bat')">
            📦 Đồng bộ / Khôi phục CSDL PRODUCTION
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-db-stg" onclick="runScript('KHOI_PHUC_DB_STAGING.bat')">
            ⚙️ Đồng bộ / Khôi phục CSDL STAGING
        </button>

        <div class="group-title">3. Khôi phục ảnh R2 lên Google Sheets</div>
        <button class="btn" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #7c3aed 100%); margin-bottom: 8px;" onclick="runScript('python scratch/restore_missing_photos.py')">
            🖼️ Mô phỏng khôi phục ảnh (Dry Run - 5 căn)
        </button>
        <button class="btn" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899 0%, #db2777 100%);" onclick="runScript('python scratch/restore_missing_photos.py --run')">
            ⚡ Ghi đè khôi phục ảnh thực tế (5 căn)
        </button>

        <div class="group-title">4. Quản trị tệp tin sao lưu</div>
        <button class="btn btn-folder" onclick="openFolder('d:\\LHTBrain\\BDS_Backups')">
            📂 Mở thư mục sao lưu CSDL (Backups)
        </button>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        Hệ điều hành: Windows • Khang Ngô Nhà Phố Local Curator Admin Panel
    </div>
</body>
</html>
